  <item>
    <title>Buses replace trains between Tonbridge and Wadhurst from Saturday</title>
    <link>https://theknowledgecabinet.github.io/hastings-news/2026/10/24/buses-replace-trains-between-tonbridge-and-wadhurst-from-saturday/</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">story-9</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 24 Oct 2026 07:00:00 +0100</pubDate>
    <category>Traffic &amp; roadworks</category>
    <description>No trains will run between Tonbridge and Wadhurst from Saturday 24 October until Sunday 1 November, as Network Rail carries out major work on the Hastings line. Rail replacement buses will operate throughout, and the closure extends to Battle on the final day.</description>
